reasons={1:'Retain the source emblem broad diagonal ribbons, upper notch and rounded inner return. Natural optical bounds and compact parallel returns are intentional, with the previously pinched opening enlarged.',2:'Preserve eight elongated ICQ petals around a central disc. Compact radial petal joins and the optical circular envelope retain the recognizable logo at 48px.',3:'Preserve the broad oval speech bubble, angular tail and large house. Natural curved envelope and roof-to-bubble clearance are visually clear at 48px.',4:'Preserve a readable serif lowercase information i and angular speech tail; compact lower-serif-to-frame spacing remains visibly open.',6:'Preserve an invoice with a dollar mark and item lines projecting above a folded open envelope. Small fold corners and nested text clearance are essential to distinguish invoice mail.',7:'Preserve the original broad horizontal infinity proportions; the otherwise clean geometry is shorter than the predefined horizontal rectangle.',8:'Retain two recognizable pointed snake heads, long serpentine tails and offset intertwined coils. Simplify the four-head reference motif to two snakes for clear native-size reading; preserve natural shape and compact head joins.',9:'Preserve the prominent hub, vertical link, and three circular markers on true diamond bases. Compact pin/base junctions and small diamond interiors are essential semantic cues.',10:'Preserve broad horizontal infinity proportions and tangent-continuous loops; accept the shorter optical envelope rather than stretch the sign vertically.',11:'Preserve the inflatable raft rim, inner cockpit and separate paddle. Compact parallel rim and cockpit spacing remain clearly separated at native size.',12:'Preserve the enclosed face, hood, broad shoulders and wrapped scarf folds. Compact face-to-hood spacing and the natural outer envelope are visually clear.',13:'Preserve the enclosed face, hood, broad shoulders and two wrapped scarf folds. Close enclosure spacing is intentional and reviewed at native size.',14:'Preserve the flower ornament, swept hair and crossed kimono collar. Compact ornament spacing and natural asymmetric hair envelope retain identifying features; circular jaw and shoulders have zero visible contact gap.',15:'Preserve two distinct iteration loops and three arrowheads. Natural loop envelope and intentional loop junction preserve the workflow meaning.',16:'Preserve three explicit hexagonal nodes around the three-face cube. The exact natural envelope extends beyond the chosen keyshape but remains inside the 48px canvas.',17:'Preserve the flower ornament, swept bob and crossed kimono collar. Compact hair/flower spacing and asymmetric silhouette retain identity; jaw and shoulders meet with zero visible gap.',18:'Preserve front pocket curves and the fly in long straight jeans. Small connected pocket interiors are intentional garment details, visually reviewed in both themes.',19:'Preserve an inclined held javelin, bent throwing arm and running legs. Compact limb spacing and optical envelope retain the action; the upper torso is vertical under its head with an exact 4px visible gap.',20:'Preserve the complete judge robe, V collar, central seam and diagonal gavel. Compact gavel-to-robe relationships retain the judicial subject and remain recognizable at 48px.'}
omissions={1:'Minor logo irregularities simplified while retaining the broad ribbon layout.',2:'Petal asymmetry and color omitted; retained eight petals.',5:'No additional angular mark: the supplied original shows only two overlapping circles.',6:'Fine invoice typography reduced to two item lines and a dollar mark.',7:'No meaning-bearing element omitted.',8:'Four-head rotational motif reduced to two pointed snake heads with long curved bodies; the four-head attempts are retained for comparison.',9:'No meaning-bearing component omitted; marker bases remain diamond-shaped.',10:'No meaning-bearing element omitted.',11:'Reduced two seat bars to one to keep the inflatable rim and cockpit clear.',12:'Facial features omitted as in the reference; retained the scarf wrap.',13:'Facial features omitted as in the reference; retained the scarf wrap.',14:'Fine hair details omitted; retained flower and crossed garment collar.',17:'Fine hair details omitted; retained flower and crossed garment collar.',19:'Reduced the filled source figure to the shared outlined-head and stroke-limb style; retained throwing pose and javelin.',20:'Facial features omitted; retained full robe and gavel.'}
for d in xs:
 p=Path(d['module']);r=Path(d['run']);icon=load_icon(p);rep=icon.validate_icon();g=gate(p)
